==Description==
The '''GraveDigger Nametag''' is a nametag that was obtained from a [[Grave Digger Mini Plush]] code.

The '''GraveDigger Nametag''' has green text and a black outline. Particles appear from it, with first one a small red dot that moves around it and the second being a red skull, which appears to be the same one that the [[Boss]] immunity uses as an icon.

